<span style="font-size:110%">'''Dispute overview'''</span>

A dispute exists over [https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Military%E2%80%93industrial_complex&diff=prev&oldid=1328779087 this diff]. [[Draft:Potential dangers (military-industrial complex)|The draft]] was proposed more than a month ago in the midst of [[Wikipedia:Dispute_resolution_noticeboard/Archive_265#Military–industrial_complex#Connotations|a previous DRN case]] on a related, but distinct, topic that made inclusion of this material look like a good idea for the sake of balance. I worked with one of the other disputants in that case to get the draft into good condition, and then added it to the article. I'm surprised that it was then deleted given that all involved parties were [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Dispute_resolution_noticeboard/Archive_265#c-Uhoj-20251120160500-Apfelmaische-20251119191100 invited to edit] the draft and no arguments against inclusion were made. To the contrary, there was [https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Draft:Potential_dangers_(military-industrial_complex)&action=history a burst of productive editing] on the draft.

<span style="font-size:110%">'''How have you tried to resolve this dispute before coming here?'''</span>

[[Draft_talk:Potential_dangers_(military-industrial_complex)]][https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Military%E2%80%93industrial_complex#c-Uhoj-20251206185100-Uhoj-20251115024900][https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Dispute_resolution_noticeboard/Archive_265#c-Uhoj-20251119164600-Zeroth_statement_by_Uhoj][https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Dispute_resolution_noticeboard/Archive_265#c-Uhoj-20251203201100-First_statement_by_Uhoj]

